<view class="page data-v-a0ac845f"><page-navbar wx:if="{{a}}" class="data-v-a0ac845f" u-i="a0ac845f-0" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{a}}"/><view class="body data-v-a0ac845f"><view class="hint data-v-a0ac845f">聊天里发营养成分表图片，并在文字中带上「食物」（如「每日坚果 食物」），识别成功后会自动保存。也可搜索后一键加入今日饮食。</view><view class="search-bar data-v-a0ac845f"><input class="search-input data-v-a0ac845f" placeholder="搜索食物名称" confirm-type="search" value="{{b}}" bindinput="{{c}}"/><view wx:if="{{d}}" class="search-clear data-v-a0ac845f" bindtap="{{e}}">清除</view></view><view class="form-card data-v-a0ac845f"><view class="form-title data-v-a0ac845f">{{f}}</view><view wx:if="{{g}}" class="form-hint data-v-a0ac845f">手动新增只需填名称等基础信息；完整营养可在聊天识图入库后再编辑。</view><input class="input data-v-a0ac845f" placeholder="食品名称" maxlength="200" value="{{h}}" bindinput="{{i}}"/><input class="input data-v-a0ac845f" type="digit" placeholder="每份重量（g，可选）" value="{{j}}" bindinput="{{k}}"/><input class="input data-v-a0ac845f" type="digit" placeholder="热量 kcal / 100g（可选）" value="{{l}}" bindinput="{{m}}"/><block wx:if="{{n}}"><view class="form-section data-v-a0ac845f">每 100g 营养（完整）</view><view class="row data-v-a0ac845f"><input class="input half data-v-a0ac845f" type="digit" placeholder="蛋白质 g" value="{{o}}" bindinput="{{p}}"/><input class="input half data-v-a0ac845f" type="digit" placeholder="脂肪 g" value="{{q}}" bindinput="{{r}}"/></view><view class="row data-v-a0ac845f"><input class="input half data-v-a0ac845f" type="digit" placeholder="碳水 g" value="{{s}}" bindinput="{{t}}"/><input class="input half data-v-a0ac845f" type="digit" placeholder="糖 g" value="{{v}}" bindinput="{{w}}"/></view><view class="row data-v-a0ac845f"><input class="input half data-v-a0ac845f" type="digit" placeholder="膳食纤维 g" value="{{x}}" bindinput="{{y}}"/><input class="input half data-v-a0ac845f" type="digit" placeholder="钠 mg" value="{{z}}" bindinput="{{A}}"/></view></block><view class="row buttons data-v-a0ac845f"><view class="primary-button data-v-a0ac845f" bindtap="{{C}}">{{B}